"instructions accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/downloading-installing-upgrading/installation-guide.rst:49
#: 3cb2ebce909349369a5e36c483a5f04b
msgid ""
"There are important :doc:`security considerations </user/downloading-"
